      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Karnataka Ratna is the highest civilian honour conferred by the State Government of Karnataka.",
        "Rajyotsava Award is Karnataka's second highest civilian honour, awarded across various fields.",
        "Karnataka writers hold a distinguished record of winning the Jnanpith Award for Kannada literature.",
        "Several eminent personalities connected to Karnataka have been honoured with the Bharat Ratna.",
        "Sahitya Akademi awards recognize outstanding literary merit in the Kannada language."
